# inc-frim: builds the orc barbarian that S1, S3 and S4 of
# tools/check_reapply_single_grant.sh used to build fresh from chargen.keys on
# three different seeds, and SAVES him for tools/make_char_fixture.sh to freeze
# (fixture orc-barbarian-reapply-seed4). A fresh build drew a different
# character per seed, and the check's verdict followed it. Not included by
# anything; the three key scripts load the frozen fixture instead.
# Seed 4 is the seed S1 passed on. Ends like lizardfolk-monk-save.keys: no
# @quit, so the session holds exactly one save.
@include chargen.keys
ESC                     # System Menu
@expect "System Menu"
b                       # [b] Save and Continue
@dump:saved
